From: AshesTom <258768419+AshesTom@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] uxtheme: export the classic metrics and 96 DPI theme metrics functions

Purpose: let XP's Display Properties (themeui.dll) open its Themes,
Desktop and Appearance pages.
XP behavior: themeui reads the classic (unthemed) system metrics through
uxtheme's ClassicSystemParametersInfo, ClassicGetSystemMetrics and
ClassicAdjustWindowRectEx, and theme metrics at 96 DPI.
Wine before: unimplemented stubs, which abort the program.
Change: forward the Classic functions to user32, which draws the classic
metrics when no theme hook is active, and the 96 DPI functions to
GetThemeSysSize and GetThemeSysFont.
Scope: every Wine application (these were stubs).
---
 dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec b/dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec
index cb07007..88e1dfe 100644
--- a/dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec
+++ b/dlls/uxtheme/uxtheme.spec
@@ -13,8 +13,8 @@
 15 stub -noname DumpLoadedThemeToTextFile
 16 stub -noname OpenThemeDataFromFile
 17 stub -noname OpenThemeFileFromData
-18 stub -noname GetThemeSysSize96
-19 stub -noname GetThemeSysFont96
+18 stdcall -noname GetThemeSysSize96(ptr long) GetThemeSysSize
+19 stdcall -noname GetThemeSysFont96(ptr long ptr) GetThemeSysFont
 20 stub -noname SessionAllocate
 21 stub -noname SessionFree
 22 stub -noname ThemeHooksOn
@@ -32,10 +32,10 @@
 34 stdcall -noname ThemeHooksInstall()
 35 stdcall -noname ThemeHooksRemove()
 36 stub -noname RefreshThemeForTS
-43 stub -noname ClassicGetSystemMetrics
-44 stub -noname ClassicSystemParametersInfoA
-45 stub -noname ClassicSystemParametersInfoW
-46 stub -noname ClassicAdjustWindowRectEx
+43 stdcall -noname ClassicGetSystemMetrics(long) user32.GetSystemMetrics
+44 stdcall -noname ClassicSystemParametersInfoA(long long ptr long) user32.SystemParametersInfoA
+45 stdcall -noname ClassicSystemParametersInfoW(long long ptr long) user32.SystemParametersInfoW
+46 stdcall -noname ClassicAdjustWindowRectEx(ptr long long long) user32.AdjustWindowRectEx
 47 stdcall DrawThemeBackgroundEx(ptr ptr long long ptr ptr)
 48 stub -noname GetThemeParseErrorInfo
 49 stub @
